# `/rename` while a turn streams (D1 follow-up): upstream renames at once,
# streaming or not (`handleRenameCommand`, `app_commands.zig:3815-3858`) --
# the notice and the window title come before the answer is over -- and the
# title is the session's after a relaunch.
gateway rename-midturn-turns.json
wait 4
type count to ten slowly
key Enter
held
wait 1
type /rename Counted mid turn
wait 0.3
key Enter
wait 0.8
snap during
title during
release
wait 5
snap after
keep
type /quit
wait 0.3
key Enter
wait 2
fx: relaunch --resume-last
xfx: relaunch --resume last
wait 4
snap relaunched
title relaunched
